@page "/services"
<PageTitle>Northstar Workshop | Services</PageTitle>
<section class="services-page">
    <div id="intro" class="page-intro">
<span class="badge text-bg-secondary">A CLEAR PATH FROM IDEA TO REALITY</span>

<h2>A practical partner for your next project.</h2>

<p>Choose a focused consultation or a complete design journey. We keep the process clear, collaborative, and grounded in what you actually need.</p>
</div>
    <div id="services" class="card-grid">
<article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>01 / Space planning</h3><p>Layout options, circulation, and storage planning. Leave with a practical direction for your shop, office, or studio.</p></div></article>

<article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>02 / Bespoke pieces</h3><p>Furniture and fixtures designed for your space. We consider materials, maintenance, and the small details you touch every day.</p></div></article>

<article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>03 / Design review</h3><p>A fresh pair of eyes on an existing plan. We identify what works, what needs attention, and where to focus your budget.</p></div></article>
</div>
    <div id="process-heading" class="section-heading">
<h2>How we work together</h2>

<p>Open a step to learn more</p>
</div>
    <div id="process" class="faq-list">
<details><summary>01 — Listen and understand</summary><p>We start with your goals, the space, the people using it, and a realistic budget. You do not need a polished brief.</p></details>

<details><summary>02 — Explore and agree</summary><p>We share a clear direction, discuss the options together, and agree the scope before moving into the details.</p></details>

<details><summary>03 — Make and refine</summary><p>With the plan agreed, we coordinate the details and review progress with you. Questions are welcome at every step.</p></details>
</div>
</section>
